.TH mbgrdviz-qt 1 "7 November 2026" "MB-System 5.0" "MB-System 5.0"
.SH NAME
\fBmbgrdviz-qt\fP \- Simple interactive 2D/3D visualization of GMT grids (Qt6 version).

.SH VERSION
Version 5.0

.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmbgrdviz-qt\fP
.br
[--grid-file=grdfile {-Igrdfile}
.br
--help {-H}
.br
--overlay-file=grdfile {-Jgrdfile}
.br
--test {-T}
.br
--verbose {-V}]

.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBmbgrdviz-qt\fP is a Qt6 port of \fBmbgrdviz\fP. The two programs share
their program logic and the \fBmbview\fP drawing code, so they open the same
grids, overlays, sites, routes, navigation, swath data, vectors, polylines,
polygons, points and shapefiles, and they write the same site, route, survey,
profile and GIS files. A file saved by one program can be opened by the other.

The windows, menus, mouse modes and keys are those of \fBmbgrdviz\fP; see
\fBmbgrdviz\fP(1) for the interactive controls, the mouse and keyboard
actions and the file formats. The map is drawn by the original OpenGL drawing
code of \fBmbview\fP in an OpenGL 2.1 compatibility context. The windows can be
resized.

